Jev.Net is an unofficial C# port of the official TypeSafe AI Python SDK
(https://github.com/typesafe-ai/typesafe-sdk-python), which is
Copyright (c) TypeSafe AI and distributed under the MIT License. It was read
at release 0.7.0. Request shape, header protection, error mapping and message
text, retry and Retry-After handling, and response validation paths follow
that library, and the test suite mirrors that library's tests.

"TypeSafe", "Jev" and "System One" are names of TypeSafe AI's products. This
project is not affiliated with, sponsored by, or endorsed by TypeSafe AI.
